  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate High-Level Investment Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To invest in activities which will build climate resilience and promote low carbon growth in Ethiopia. This will help 1.5 million people to cope with the effects of climate change by 2015, help Ethiopia to protect livelihoods, services, infrastructure and energy supplies from the effects of climate change, and establish its green growth path</narrative>
  </description>
